      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "B921\nIt seems that there is a bug that the position of the player is ridiculous if you are in the instance for a long time.\nI sometimes sleep with my friends on the same instance overnight, but when I wake up, I've seen them fly around with tremendous momentum.\nClearly something is wrong with SYNC.",
