  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Yesterday, during the lesson, we noticed Wardragon cannot see some players. After update, Wardragon see other friend at wrong location.\nJoin the world again sometimes fixed the problem.\n\nThere is still chance for sync problems between many players, especially in busy worlds.\nThe photo here taken from same location from Wardragon and GT4Tube showed pretty much players are not there.\nFrom my side is just one missed.\nBut this way is not great, it happens again twice with strange sync issues between clients. This is important problem to avoid confusion beteen players.\nGT4Tube and me are in Europe, Wardragon is from America. Does it count as sensitive distance or not?\n\nThere are some things to notice:\nWardragon started the invite+ world and he is master of the world. So he is first there.\nI come to the world slight later at 18 ppl.\nGT4Tube was there before me.",
